janssonr (0.0.1.3-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Depend on r-base-core of at least the build R minor, via an
    r:Depends substvar computed at build time. The compiled .so imports
    ANY_ATTRIB (R >= 4.5 headers) and the package floor is R >= 4.4;
    stock noble's R 4.3.3 satisfied the previous unversioned
    r-base-core and would have failed at load.

 -- Troy Hernandez <troy@cornball.ai>  Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:20:00 +0000

janssonr (0.0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging: r-cornball-janssonr, built with debhelper
    so runtime dependencies (libc6, libjansson4) come from shlibdeps
    rather than being hardcoded.

 -- Troy Hernandez <troy@cornball.ai>  Mon, 10 Aug 2026 22:30:00 +0000
